        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lwa mpungatī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū, ī ligūlū nī sī shūbiza shamala ū kūbeejiwa, na a mabità gose ayo galīmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu lūshikū lwa mpugatī, ū Mulungu ūsangwa wamalile ū kūtūmama; hūna lūūlū wifuula ī milīmo yakwe pyī ī yose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ūlūfuuha ū lūshikū lwa mpungatī, ūlweeja; nguno ū mu lūshikū lwenūlo akifuula pyī ī milīmo yakwe īyo akabeeja mu kaseemele kakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Munhū kūtūūlwa mu ngūnda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū būsombooji ūbū būlī bo mihayo ya shiseeng'wa sha ng'wigūlū na mu sī gīt'umo shikabeegejiwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu aho wamala kūseema ī sī nī ligūlū, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "shaalī shitīho sha kūzwa mu matogolo; ī sī yalī ītī na ntī nūūlū gūmò, nguno ū SEEBA Mulungu walī ataalī ū kwīyīta ī mbula ītūle a ha sī. Hama nīyo walī atīho munhū wa kwīlīma ī sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike jalīho nzwīlo",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:6",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nzwīlo:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, ikūngūkū.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " jenhaga minzī kūfuma mu gatī ya sī, bobiza ho būdoto a ha sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū SEEBA Mulungu ūmeeja munhū kūfuma mu malongo ga ha sī; ūng'haahīla myūyī ya būpanga ū mu mūūlū gakwe ū munhū ng'wenūyo, ūbiza mpanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu walī wagolanya ngūnda ipandī lya kīya, mu Edeni; ūntūūla ng'wenūmo ū munhū ūyo akamūmba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū, ū SEEBA Mulungu wīyinha ī sī būdūla bo kūzwisha mitī ya būlī mbika; mitī misoga kūlola, na yawiza kūlyiwa. A ha gatī ya ngūnda ūtūūla ho ntī gwa būpanga, na ntī gwa kūmana misoga na mibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mongo gwahūūmaga kūfuma ū mu Edeni gwitīīla minzī ū mu ngūnda. Nīyo ū mongo gwenūyo gwalī gūgabanīkile matambī anè, kwīngīīla haho henaho yilonga myongo īnè. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū go kwandya ū mu myongo yenīyo ī lina lyago gwalī Pishoni, gwalī gūbītīlile mu sī ya Havila, sī ya zahabu; gūūbīta ū mu sī yenīyo gūkūtūlaga kuluba, kūshisha gūūkafuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī zahabu ja mu sī yenīyo jalī niza no, jalīmo na delamu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Delamu:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūla ga mitī milebe īkanung'haga chiza, gakabeejiagwa na būgota.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " na lapisi lazuli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:12",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Lazuli:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Mawe malabagīzu gakasīmbagwa ha sī mu sī jimò na jimò.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū go kabīlī gwitanagwa Gihoni, nū gwene gwalī gūjile gūkūtūlaga kuluba kūbītīla mu sī ya Kushi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Kushi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bangī bahayile yalī Mesopotamia ya dakama.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū gwa kadatū gwitanagwa Hidekeli, ū goyi gūtūlile kuluba kūja kīya ya sī ya Ashulu. Lelo ū gwa kanè gwalī Flati.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu ūnsola ū munhū, ūntūūla ū mu ngūnda gwa Edeni gīkī ayūgūlīma na kūgūlang'hana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA Mulungu ūnagīla ū munhū alīhaya gīkī, “Ūdūgije kūlya matwajo ga ntī gose gose ū mu ngūnda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo yaya ū kūgalya a matwajo ga ntī gwa kūmana misoga na mibi; nguno ūlū ūūgalya ūkūcha gete!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ngosha kūpandīka nke",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA Mulungu ūhaya gīkī, “Ītī yawiza ū ngosha ikale iyene, nakūmeegeja ng'wiye wa kūngunanha.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu walī wamala kūbeeja kūfuma mu malongo ga ha sī, pyī ī shiinū ja mu matogolo, nī noni ja higūlya. Hūna lūūlū wandya kūjenha ū kūlī Adamu gīkī abone a mina ayo akūjinha; ū Adamu ūmo akashitanīla būlī shiseeng'wa, ī lyenīlo hū līkabiza lina lyasho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ng'hana ū Adamu ūjinha mina pyī ī mitugo, nī noni ja hape, hamò nī ndimu, nī shiinū ja mu matogolo. Alīyo ū Adamu atapandīkile ng'wiye wa kwigeleelwa kūngunanha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA Mulungu ūnaalīkīja ū Adamu tūlo nhaale. Aho alaalile ūng'wīngīja iguha līmò lya mu lūbazu, ūtūūla maanda a ha ng'wanya ūyo gūkalekwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu ūlībeeja nkīma ī liguha lya lūbazu īlo akang'wīngīja ū Adamu, hūna ūng'wenha ū nkīma a halī Adamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Adamu ūhaya gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
